# Single build context for every image in deploy/docker/ (builds run from the repo root).
# Allow-list: ignore everything, re-include only what an image needs, then
# re-exclude generated, secret and bulky files inside those folders.

*

# Shared Docker assets (nginx config)
!deploy/docker/

# npm workspace root + shared packages + portals (portal.Dockerfile)
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!packages/
!admin-portal/
!hospital-portal/
!insurance-portal/
!pharmacy-portal/
!patient-portal-desktop/

# API + worker (server.Dockerfile)
!server/

# AI service incl. the LoRA adapter in model/ (ai-service.Dockerfile)
!miqorai-ai-service/

# --- Re-excluded inside the folders above -----------------------------------
# Dependencies and build output are always rebuilt inside the image.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-ssr
**/.output
**/.vinxi
**/.tanstack
**/.vite
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Environment files and secrets must never enter an image (VITE_* come from build args).
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.local
**/*.pem
**/*.key

# VCS, editor and OS noise
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/npm-debug.log*
**/*.log

# Server runtime data and test-only files
server/uploads
server/tests
server/scripts

# Python caches and model training artifacts not needed at inference time
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.venv
miqorai-ai-service/model/**/checkpoint-*
miqorai-ai-service/model/**/training_args.bin
miqorai-ai-service/model/**/training_meta.json

# Documentation is not part of any image
**/*.md
